The Routing API is a member of the large Geoapify routing services family. These are other APIs based on OSM road network data. They offer a good set of tools to analyze routes and locations, find optimal travel plans and schedules:

- Map Matching API - allows you to match GPS tracks to existing road network and get extended road details ( how snap to road works );

- Distance Matrix API - calculates a matrix of distances and travel times between multiple source and target locations;

- Route Planner API - finds an optimal route between multiple locations and for multiple vehicles or agents to solve, for example, delivery planning task;

- Isolines API - returns an area reachable from a location within a given time or distance; it shows how far one can go from a given location.

