Geoapify | How to Handle Unreachable Waypoints and Routing Errors | Geoapify > Choose the next action in code

Retry only temporary failures, with a short, growing delay and a small limit:

```
async function fetchRoute(url, maxAttempts = 3) {
  for (let attempt = 1; ; attempt++) {
    const response = await fetch(url);
    const body = await response.json().catch(() => ({}));
    if (response.ok) return { route: body };

const error = classifyRoutingError(response.status, body);
    if (error.action !== "retry" || attempt === maxAttempts) {
      return { error, message: body.message };
    }
    await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 1000 * 2 ** (attempt - 1)));
  }
}
```

After a successful response, run the moved-waypoint check before you show the route.
